SUMMARY:Seafood buffet dinner cruise from Five Rivers
DESCRIPTION:Historic Blakeley State Park runs an early evening cruise from
  the Bartram dock at Five Rivers across the lower Mobile-Tensaw Delta and
  Mobile Bay at sunset. The boat ties up at the Original Oyster House for 
 a seafood buffet that includes Florentine stuffed flounder\, blackened sh
 rimp Alfredo and popcorn shrimp. The ticket includes the meal\, and the c
 ruise returns to Five Rivers by 8:15 PM.\nPrice: from $49\nArea: Mobile &
